<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is tightening security in the south after bomb explosions, while Perlis police increase border intelligence. Cambodia is facilitating ASEAN observers and raising the border dispute at international forums, with Hun Manet citing Trump’s pledge for continued US support and defending Cambodia’s position, while Min Aung Hlaing accuses Thailand of aiding illegal border trade. Malaysia is funding a RM200 million rail link to the border, but Thailand’s connection remains pending, and a $3 million project will train 4,500 Myanmar refugees for Thai jobs. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNSWhOaURsTHRuTE9KeEFpVzR5ZG9oSUQ1V0JTbmVldmNFS2NuaEt4cmhNMmhFMzhnbUU1UFRWNmpSSFZHMTV0SHRldlNBWGhmS3VUX1JHVlQtTVJqWlg5d183b3l2eW01anROeGNyT2lvWDZaQy12eWdfR3JJS045UDFjbUo0T3FzUS1JeWFQb0g1X3FkWU5KbDFXbm9KMlZRMl9LQ1BVdEY?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Irrawaddy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQbk1pM1FVOWJ5SjJfOGlMbU5lTkRNbk80MDVGTnpKOTZFZzkydzN6bjV0dVhpa3E1ajdkdlJMRHA2LWdZZ0c0dUlBeUVCS0R6TGZVdlJWV2hyaC01dUkxY0NZVmxpc2dXYU1FZGoyVWh3UDQ3RkdoOFA1WmN6cEZoeHhBcS02NHp4eEk5dHVPRUJoSjlIVXk3Z3dfQVhtM0ZZZFZSYnJ4NnZpdmYwQkNHcDBR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxOMjZmVVAzSmJDNWdNSDA3LWlocmJkY1R0TTAwNmFWRW1GaXZtU3FqSkJLanlPVlE2QmppSXp5UXFjeFBpS3FFdjE5Wm90WTljR3pvMkZNVGk1cHpFT1hqRy10Nl9LTU5VX3hDQWI2R0V5X2c2U2NnREpiYWZNYmtCMFpyNWhWWFBINXN1dkVPOUE0MTlyaVRIZHFMeTdnSnVQbXRubjhBbTEyQXJXWG5ENnhNOFRZeFo0QXVuazB1a0JyMkNYWW9MZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRP | The Rakyat Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPU2c4VGVzWUR6RmJnQk1hZVdmb0s4eHV3U3ktMGpnMzFMOWNPRWJoMW1ZQ3ZOaWxpOGNCb2tXbkFNaVdtd2VyU0JmY0lBN0dVVH